---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="RelayBridge website privacy" description="How RelayBridge uses Cloudflare for hosting and aggregate analytics without advertising trackers, behavioral advertising, or marketing cookies.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Website privacy" title="A small website" accent="with a small data footprint." description="This static website uses Cloudflare for hosting, security, and aggregate traffic and performance analytics. It does not use advertising trackers, behavioral advertising, marketing cookies, or user accounts." />
  <section class="section section-white">
    <div class="container privacy-layout">
      <aside><span>LAST UPDATED</span><strong>23 August 2026</strong></aside>
      <div class="prose privacy-prose">
        <section><h2>Analytics and tracking</h2><p>RelayBridge does not use advertising analytics, marketing trackers, behavioral advertising, or intentionally track people across websites. The public site does not create visitor profiles, provide user accounts, or collect RelayBridge product telemetry. Aggregate website traffic and performance analytics are provided through Cloudflare.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Hosting infrastructure</h2><p>Cloudflare provides hosting, content delivery, and security services for this website. Cloudflare may process ordinary request metadata needed to deliver, cache, protect, and measure the site, such as an IP address, requested URL, timestamp, browser or user-agent information, response status, and network or security signals. Cloudflare also uses request metadata to provide aggregate edge and zone traffic analytics.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Cloudflare Web Analytics</h2><p>Cloudflare Web Analytics is enabled on the production site. Cloudflare automatically injects its browser performance beacon when serving production HTML. It collects aggregate page-view and performance information. Cloudflare documents Web Analytics as privacy-first and cookie-free: it does not use analytics cookies or localStorage-based visitor identification, does not fingerprint individuals for analytics, and does not track individual visitors across Cloudflare customers' websites.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Cookies and local storage</h2><p>RelayBridge itself does not set advertising or marketing cookies. Cloudflare Web Analytics does not use cookies or localStorage to identify visitors. Cloudflare may use strictly necessary cookies for separately enabled security or traffic-management features, such as responding to abusive or automated traffic; those are infrastructure cookies rather than advertising analytics.</p></section>
        <section><h2>External links</h2><p>This website links to external services such as GitHub and email clients. Those services operate under their own privacy terms. RelayBridge does not embed third-party advertising or social-media widgets.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about this website can be sent to <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@getrelaybridge.com">info@getrelaybridge.com</a>. Sending email shares the information you include with the receiving mail provider.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Changes</h2><p>This statement will be updated if the website changes its analytics, hosting, support systems, forms, or other data-processing features.</p></section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
